# Archive of the Calliope half of the Gallope/Calliope determinism
# comparison, copied from Miyabi-G (~/work/determinism) before the machine
# was decommissioned.  The Gallope half, and the protocol document that
# explains what the numbers mean, live in gallope_dev/tests/determinism/.
#
# Tracked here: the run definitions, the job scripts, the PBS/stdout logs,
# the comparison results, and the analysis scripts that produced them.
#
# Not tracked: rms.dat and cfl.dat.  They are kept in this directory (and so
# are backed up by Dropbox) but they are bulk time series, not evidence.
# restart/*.dat -- the field data the comparison actually reads -- was
# deliberately not copied from Miyabi; the verdicts it produced are in
# compare_all_fixed.out, probe_all_fixed.out and rmhd/compare_rmhd.out.
#
# The comparison results are re-included by name, not as *.out, so that
# <code>.modes.out -- a 3 MB per-step mode dump that no script here reads --
# cannot be pulled back in by the pattern.
*
!*/
__pycache__/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.in
!job.pbs-*
!out.std
!compare_*.out
!probe_*.out
!*.o[0-9]*
!*.py
!*.sh
